# LogLoads — AE Control bootstrap

Product requirements in this repository stay authoritative. This rule does not replace `AGENTS.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, or `docs/product/`.

Before substantive work:

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and the product decision files it names.
2. Read `C:\Users\Cole0\AutomatedEmpires\Projects\AE-Control\registry\projects.json` and `policy\continuity.md`.
3. Run the read-only session script:

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -File C:\Users\Cole0\AutomatedEmpires\Projects\AE-Control\scripts\session.ps1 -Project logloads -Issue <number> -Agent <registry id>
```

